 pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xLwMbzebDZ4Q7kNvwF-VG2f&_nc_oc=Adqq5QKd3en_ajVQzOtGqehkmIbrTSToYG1G9bOGTPXFfZUrgof4z4TkZCBYbcK8bG4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIVNSIGKpqZfP3tVGx3SySpMD4W8iKdN9P3w1sYHgMRfg&oe=6AA962B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n0chDoKLYQ0Q7kNvwHrF6zE&_nc_oc=AdrYwiFpE08LpicY9aXLuERy5Kv66N8hdc7l-avZ4CD9xwA2H7WgwbMpYKXgsbZuHyU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKmxeeC7p6BREiG39h4XD18RieroQkUP5JFSrIAIYnuUg&oe=6AA96416"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4tn2BIjUPKoQ7kNvwF0Dh9i&_nc_oc=Adp-6WEIXa5L8XMG5hE2TuzQD7EeqlZEGaN8mza230R93dQ6oa0gCpqaV8-Ki0K00g8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJso5oSdVXHlGWB1Y-G01sx8BVe33IKCJ7Z0-pV0yVM5w&oe=6AA940F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "